# Verification temp renders and helper scripts.
# Session policy: these are per-cycle artifacts and are NEVER committed.
# Background autosave sweeps untracked files, so they must be ignored here.
citefix_*.png
figchk_*.png
lsfix_*.png
lscont_*.png
# Every per-cycle page render, whatever this cycle happened to call it.
# One pattern replaces the earlier read_p*/readfix_/read_cycle* trio so a new
# prefix cannot slip through: an hourly autosave sweeps untracked files, so a
# render committed once is a render tracked forever.
read*.png
crop_*.png
sweep_*.png
spot_*.png
r1fix_*.png
r2_v_*.png
fix_t_*.png
cut150_*.png
cap_lof*
